1
00:00:00,489 --> 00:00:04,279
(Sheldon:)When she's upset,
she says "ack" and eats ice cream.

2
00:00:07,412 --> 00:00:09,202
(Penny:)Um....

3
00:00:09,373 --> 00:00:10,543
(Penny:)Ack.

4
00:00:12,584 --> 00:00:15,714
And if you were a cat,
I would have brought you a lasagna.

5
00:00:17,506 --> 00:00:19,386
(Penny:)Did Leonard send you over here?

6
00:00:19,591 --> 00:00:23,091
(Sheldon:)No. We haven't spoken
since your abrupt departure last night...

7
00:00:23,261 --> 00:00:26,811
(Sheldon:)...caused us to forfeit to Stuart
and his dastardly ringer, Wil Wheaton.

8
00:00:27,641 --> 00:00:28,931
(Penny:)Yeah, I'm sorry about that.

9
00:00:29,142 --> 00:00:32,392
(Sheldon:)Not too proud to admit
that I cried myself to sleep.

10
00:00:33,271 --> 00:00:35,061
(Penny:)-Again, I'm sorry.
-Let me tell you...

11
00:00:35,232 --> 00:00:36,732
(Sheldon:)...sleep did not come easily...

12
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,700
(Sheldon:)...with Leonard in the next room
singing along with Alanis Morissette.

13
00:00:42,698 --> 00:00:43,948
(Penny:)-You're kidding.
-No.

14
00:00:44,157 --> 00:00:46,537
(Sheldon:)Clearly another woman
in dire need of ice cream.

15
00:00:48,286 --> 00:00:50,916
(Penny:)What part of this is supposed
to make me feel better?

16
00:00:51,123 --> 00:00:54,293
(Sheldon:)The part where I tell you
I've engineered a rematch...

17
00:00:54,459 --> 00:00:56,169
(Sheldon:)...with Stuart's team for tonight.

18
00:00:56,378 --> 00:01:00,088
(Penny:)Oh, honey, I don't know. Things
are a little weird with Leonard right now.

